{"overview":"وقتی کارمند اداری تاکاهیرو ساتو در داخل بازی علمی-تخیلی مورد علاقه‌اش بیدار می‌شود، متوجه می‌شود که او فرمانده یک فضاپیما قدرتمند است. او به عنوان هِیرو، مزدور، به سوی ستارگان می‌رود، در حین مبارزه با دشمنان و جمع‌آوری متحدان. اما به زودی با یک مشکل بزرگ روبه‌رو می‌شود: او هیچ خانه‌ای ندارد و مهم‌تر از همه، هیچ نوشیدنی گازدار ندارد! تنها کاری که می‌تواند انجام دهد… خرید خانه‌ای در سیاره‌ای است!","tagline":"","overview_en":"When office worker Takahiro Satou awakens inside his favorite sci-fi game, he finds himself commanding a powerful spaceship. He takes to the stars as Hiro the mercenary, battling enemies and gathering allies along the way. But he soon faces a big problem: he has no home and, more importantly, no carbonated drinks! There’s only one thing to do…buy himself a house on a planet!","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/ccLkKM9nZ4eR2ZjDg2vpOCInZro.jpg"}],"episodes":13,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"古川慎","role":"Captain Hiro (voice)","photo":"/inLmBZhrqXeE9wlViyK28ocKJSw.jpg","en":"Makoto Furukawa"},{"name":"稲垣好","role":"Mimi (voice)","photo":"/qYizWDjykF0j5foMvKGYyRta037.jpg","en":"Konomi Inagaki"},{"name":"آنا ناگاسه","role":"Elma (voice)","photo":"/gFKRUlUlqTD7jGdysg5IWIvgoCH.jpg","en":"Anna Nagase"},{"name":"白石晴香","role":"Serena Holz (voice)","photo":"/hrQxTVNGLi3jXC7v4kETArpA0dV.jpg","en":"Haruka Shiraishi"},{"name":"大西沙織","role":"Shoko (voice)","photo":"/cziKB19QMFJ6DQDtxTn07uRY2hq.jpg","en":"Saori Onishi"},{"name":"植田佳奈","role":"Mei (voice)","photo":"/us6FMwXCeSUR2YyByxVcgOUjiIA.jpg","en":"Kana Ueda"}],"trailer":"tiXRpYimOsQ","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/283692/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/283692